---
// Khao Sok Hot Springs (Rommanee Mineral Springs) — Authentic Guide & Booking
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Hot Springs (Rommanee Springs)"
  description="Relax in naturally heated mineral waters at Rommanee Hot Springs near Khao Sok. Tiled pools, scenic valley viewpoint, and soothing geothermal baths."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/khao-sok-riverside-cottages-beach.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Hot Springs"
  heroSubtitle="Rommanee Geothermal Mineral Springs & Mountain Viewpoint"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Activities", "href": "/khao-sok-tours/"}, {"label": "Hot Springs", "href": "/khao-sok-hot-springs/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>ACTIVITIES & WELLNESS</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#12281b] font-bold tracking-tight">
          Naturally Heated Geothermal Baths in Khao Sok
        </h2>

        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Looking for total relaxation after a day of hiking or lake exploration? Rommanee Hot Springs features naturally heated mineral water pouring from underground geothermal springs into beautifully maintained tiled pools where you can sit, soak, and unwind.
        </p>

        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          With a clean, peaceful atmosphere, the hot springs are a favorite destination for both travelers and locals, giving you an authentic taste of Southern Thai wellness culture. The mineral-rich waters range in temperature across multiple pools, allowing you to choose the warmth that feels best.
        </p>

        <!-- Highlights Card -->
        <div class="bg-[#12281b]/5 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-2xl p-6 my-8 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7a5813] font-bold">
            Key Information & Rates
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm text-[#223e2c]">
            <div class="p-3 bg-white/70 rounded-xl border border-[#12281b]/10">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#255038] uppercase font-mono block">Price per Person</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#12281b]">฿600 – ฿800 Baht</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#12281b]/70 block mt-0.5">Includes round-trip private transport</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white/70 rounded-xl border border-[#12281b]/10">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#255038] uppercase font-mono block">Duration & Distance</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#12281b]">Approx. 2 Hours</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#12281b]/70 block mt-0.5">15-min scenic drive from resort</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white/70 rounded-xl border border-[#12281b]/10">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#255038] uppercase font-mono block">Scenic Stop Included</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#12281b]">Khao Sok Valley Viewpoint</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#12281b]/70 block mt-0.5">Dramatic vista of limestone towers</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-white/70 rounded-xl border border-[#12281b]/10">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#255038] uppercase font-mono block">Attire Etiquette</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-base text-[#12281b]">Modest Swimwear</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#12281b]/70 block mt-0.5">Shorts & t-shirt recommended for local culture</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#12281b] font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">
          Scenic Viewpoint Stop
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          The 15-minute drive from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages winds through lush mountain passes and includes a stop at an elevated viewpoint with an unforgettable panoramic vista of the mist-shrouded limestone karst formations across the valley.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Box -->
        <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm text-[#12281b]">Reserve Upon Arrival</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#255038]">You can book this excursion at reception anytime during your stay.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href="/booking-khao-sok-accommodation/?tab=room"
              class="px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ba9038] to-[#d8b257] hover:from-[#c99f3e] hover:to-[#ebd082] text-[#12281b] font-bold rounded-xl text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Book Room at Resort
            </a>
            <a
              href="/khao-sok-tours/"
              class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#12281b] hover:bg-[#1c3d24] text-white font-medium rounded-xl text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-all"
            >
              All Activities
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
